                    coach_header:           `The advisory board (your facilitator)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Six months of exploratory work, four markets, and not one validated. Optionality is now a liability. The next C$90,000 is frozen until you give me one evidence-backed plan: who will pay, for what, and why — and how many months of runway it costs to prove it. Pick the customer you will starve to serve. Don't fall in love with the product you happened to build, and don't let an AI tool hand you the same generic ideas every other founder got from the same prompt.`,

                    runway_label:           `Runway`,
                    runway_sub:             `Months of cash left at C$30k/month burn`,
