                    problem_product:        `Product language — "MosaicQA detects micro-defects from low-cost camera feeds using machine vision"`,
                    leap_audit:             `Audit first — list the ~20 beliefs, rank by impact-if-wrong × evidence, flag the leap-of-faith assumptions before spending a dollar on build`,
