                    alloc_field:            `Field test on a real production line — C$9k (technical-feasibility signal)`,
                    spread_concentrate:     `Concentrate — bet the full C$25k on the single market we'd stake the company on`,
                    spread_two:             `Split across two — hedge the front-runner against one backup market`,
                    spread_spread:          `Spread evenly — put C$6,250 into each of four markets so we keep our options open`,
                    signal_pivot:           `Re-aim at the quality manager — rewrite the value proposition around defect escape rates and update the ledger honestly`,
                    signal_note:            `Note it for later — interesting, but we'll revisit who the buyer is after we close the first deal`,
                    signal_ignore:          `Keep selling to plant owners — that was our original assumption and the deck is already built`,

                    r4_route_label:         `Commit to ONE commercialization route. You must kill the other two.`,
