                    r4_ttm_readout:         `Time-to-MVP committed:`,
                    r4_ttm_weeks:           `weeks`,
                    r4_ttm_hint:            `Too aggressive and the MVP isn't real; too long and you sell nothing before the next raise. Burn ~C$7k of runway for every week you build before validating.`,
                    r4_milestone_label:     `Define the funding-unlock milestone — what does the next C$90k actually buy the board in proof?`,
