                    route_direct:           `Direct paid pilots with extruders — slow, high-margin, defensible; build the beachhead deal by deal`,
                    route_oem:              `Channel / OEM embed into a camera or machine vendor — fast reach, but margin and control surrendered`,
                    route_api:              `Self-serve defect API — scalable and on-brand for an AI-built team, but demand is unvalidated and time-to-revenue is longest`,
                    route_all:              `Keep all three open — we're still exploring; we'll let the market decide which one wins`,
                    milestone_paying:       `"3 paying pilots at C$5k MRR by a named date" — evidenced willingness-to-pay tied to the next raise`,
